/* Commit message:
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
By this point i had a good understanding of peace and taw's data structure and how their editors work

The parkour engine still had some flaws but as u can see, it was functional at this point :)

Many afternoons were wasted here playing Jazzy's hanamura :3
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

settings
{
	main
	{
		Description: "WIP v.20231022\n By GigaMercy"
		Mode Name: "Giga Parkour Engine"
	}

	lobby
